5. Artwork
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The pixel-art character sprite sheet
(packages/web/src/features/agency/assets/characters.png) was generated with an
AI image model (OpenAI, through the Codex CLI), then converted to a sprite
atlas and patched by hand by The Luady Authors.

The banner and the social card under .github/assets/ (banner.png,
banner@1x.png, social-card.png) were made the same way: generated with an AI
image model, then edited by hand by The Luady Authors.

The logo (.github/assets/logo-*.png, site/public/favicon.ico, apple-touch-icon.png
and brand/, packages/web/public/icon.svg and icon-maskable.svg, and the
pixel rows in packages/web/src/ui/BrandMark.tsx) was chosen from pictures made
with an AI image model, using the project's own art as reference, then redrawn
pixel by pixel as explicit pixel data, with an AI coding assistant. No pixel was
resampled from those pictures.

Purely machine-generated images may not be protected by copyright in some
jurisdictions, so this file makes no claim of exclusive rights over them.

